  "title": "GitLab CI: Don't run the AI Trailer Reminder on merge trains",
  "description": "It's run in the regular merge request, and it doesn't seem useful to\nrun it in the merge train. Also, make it interruptible, like many other\njobs, so that it cancels when new commits are pushed to the same MR.\n\nThis should prevent backing up so much.\n\nAI-Assisted: no",
